-- **Preview content:** It can go in a "Coming next" note, never in the opinion itself.
-- **A linked issue has closed:** If an opinion links an issue or pull request as an open limitation, and it has closed or shipped in a release, update or drop the note in the same scan. `audit-freshness` reports these.
+- **Nightly-only content:** It can go in a "Coming next" note, never in the opinion itself.
+- **A linked issue has closed:** If an opinion links a tracking issue or pull request as unstable or as an open limitation, and it has closed, update or drop the note in the same scan. If the feature has shipped in a stable <name> release, leave it to `refresh-<id>-versions`. `audit-freshness` finds both kinds, and names the skill for each.
